{
  "name": "03 - BudgetFlow API Client / Get Accounts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0003",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get Accounts\n\nSingle Responsibility: call GET /api/accounts and return a clean { ok, accounts } contract. On failure, notifies 04 - Notifications / System Error itself — callers just check `ok`, they never see raw HTTP status codes.\n\nRequires a BudgetFlow service API key with the `accounts:read` scope (BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY env var).\n\nNo current consumer in the main pipeline (Update Account Balance was retired) — kept available as a reusable API client for future flows (manual ops, balance-aware routing, etc.).\n\nInput: none required.\nOutput (ok=true): { ok: true, accounts: [{ id, type, name, currentBalance, latestImportedBalance, lastSMSImported, lastSuccessfulSync, reconciliationStatus, cacheDifference, bankDifference }] }\nOutput (ok=false): routes to System Error; caller sees whatever System Error's chain returns.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0002",
      "name": "On called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": []
        },
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0004",
      "name": "GET Accounts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.BUDGETFLOW_BASE_URL + '/api/accounts' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0005",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0006",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode < 400 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0007",
      "name": "Format Success Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
